==Overview==
'''The Mothership''' is an [[Astro Toilet|enemy]] that spawns on Wave 180 of [[Endless Mode|Endless Mode.]]
It was added on 4th July, 2024 during the [[Episode 75 Update]].

== Appearance ==
It has a helmet with 3 intrusions on top, a saucer-like object at the front of the rim, and 2 support attachments at the top of it, presumably to help make it spin. Armor plating around the bottom can also be seen, presumably to protect it. It features a halo on it's back, a balaclava-like mask, and a laser below it.

==Strategy==

The current strategy is to use pushback units, and major DpS. It is recommended to place towers with the piercing ability in a line to maximize their piercing and damage. Towers with the Slowing Ability and the Radioactive Sub-Ability are highly recommended. It is advised to use Timestop whenever it makes a turn, and rewind if it reaches the end of the map.  

Here's an example of what loadout to use:  

Player 1 

# [[Quantum Cameraman]] (CC + DpS)
# [[Carrot Farmer Bunnyman]] (Economy)
# [[Upgraded Titan Drilldragon]] (for the burning)
# [[Chained Watchman Of Doom]] (Slowing)
# [[Titan Luckbringer Drillman]] (Extra Dps)
# [[King Drillman]] (Booster + CC)

Player 2

# [[Titan Fanman]] (Pushback)
# [[Titan Warlord Clockman]] (CC + Booster + Rewind)
# [[Carrot Farmer Bunnyman]] (Economy)
# [[Chief Clockman]] (Booster + CC + Second Rewind)
# [[Speaker Repair Drone]] (Healer)
# [[Upgraded Titan Clockman]] (CC + Timestop)

'''(The match can have a max of 5 players, and each player can have 7 inventory slots if they have all Endless Ranks. This is just meant to be an example. You can make your own strategy and add it)'''

==Waves==
Wave 180: 12,635,013,632

Wave 1: 10,200,000

== Trivia ==

* It is based on the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Mothership_Astro_Toilet?so=search Mothership Astro Toilet] from the Skibidi Toilet series.
*It is currently the strongest toilet in the game, with 12.6 billion health, and very strong abilities.
*It scales 3.74% in health each wave
*It originally debuted on the 74th Episode of the Skibidi Toilet series, but had to be postponed to Episode 75 due to the complexity of the enemies.

